    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d38-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d38-f1-content">
                <p>Source: National Archives, Nixon
                    Presidential Materials, NSC Files, NSC Institutional Files (H-Files), Box H–114,
                    Washington Special Actions Group, WSAG Minutes,
                    Originals, 1969–1970 [6 of 6]. Top Secret; Sensitive. The meeting was held in
                    the Situation Room at the White House. Behr forwarded the minutes through Haig to Kissinger under a
                    September 22 memorandum.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
